[{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0086","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0086.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-15501","title":"L-Soft LISTSERV 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"L-Soft LISTSERV 在 16.5-2018a 之前版本存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，攻击者可构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的特制 URL，通过 /scripts/wa.exe 脚本的 OK 参数注入脚本。当用户点击该链接后，脚本会在其浏览器中执行，可导致会话劫持、敏感信息窃取或页面内容篡改。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 LISTSERV 的站点，攻击条件为远程网络访问、攻击复杂度低且无需权限，但需要用户交互（点击链接）才能触发利用。由于 XSS 脚本在用户浏览器上下文中执行，攻击者可窃取管理员凭证或冒充用户执行未授权操作。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-15501"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-26T14:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:20:29Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 L-Soft LISTSERV 至 16.5-2018a 或更高版本，可从官方网站 lsoft.com 下载最新安装包并按升级指南操作。若暂时无法升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面配置规则过滤 /scripts/wa.exe 路径下 OK 参数中的脚本载荷（如 <script>、onerror 等），或通过反向代理拦截包含恶意 XSS 载荷的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154202/LSoft-ListServ-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47302","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15501.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-15501.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15501.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-15501.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-15501-3881.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-15501-3883.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/LISTSERV/CVE-2019-15501.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2019-15501.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c67c7954c46b752d4b167913e3e046ed998744d0/cves/2019/15xxx/CVE-2019-15501.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/lsoft/listserv/CVE-2019-15501.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2019-15501.js"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0086.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0040","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0040.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-11013","title":"Nimble Streamer 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Nimble Streamer 3.0.2-2 至 3.5.4-9 版本存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。攻击者可在 HTTP 请求 URL 中构造 `../` 序列，绕过路径限制访问服务器上任意文件，如 `/etc/passwd` 等敏感系统文件。该漏洞源于软件对用户输入的文件路径缺乏充分的规范化处理，未正确限制路径名。攻击者只需拥有低权限会话（如有效的 nimblesessionid），即可通过特制的 HTTP GET 请求远程利用，无需用户交互。成功利用可导致敏感信息泄露，影响系统机密性。Softvelum 官方建议升级至 3.5.4-9 以上版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-11013"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-22T15:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:12:07Z","remediation":"立即将 Nimble Streamer 升级至 3.5.4-10 或更高版本，该版本已修复文件路径过滤不严导致的目录遍历问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器或反向代理层配置请求路径白名单，拦截包含 `../` 的 URL 请求，并限制 `nimblesessionid` 参数中特殊字符的传入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154196/Nimble-Streamer-3.x-Directory-Traversal.html","https://mayaseven.com/nimble-directory-traversal-in-nimble-streamer-version-3-0-2-2-to-3-5-4-9/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47301","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-11013.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-11013.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-11013.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-11013.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-11013-3719.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-11013-3721.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-11013-3724.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-11013-3723.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-11013-3722.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2019-11013.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Nimble Streamer/CVE-2019-11013.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0609","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0609.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-15107","title":"Webmin Webmin 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Webmin 是一款用于类 Unix 系统的 Web 界面系统管理工具。该漏洞存在于 Webmin 1.920 及更早版本的 password_change.cgi 脚本中，由于 `old` 参数未对用户输入进行充分过滤，导致存在命令注入漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送特制的 HTTP 请求，在 `old` 参数中插入操作系统命令，从而在目标服务器上以 root 权限执行任意命令，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响版本 Webmin 的系统，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-15107"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-16T03:15:11Z","updated":"2026-08-05T21:16:56Z","remediation":"强烈建议立即将 Webmin 升级至 1.930 或更高版本以彻底消除漏洞。如当前运行的是 1.900 至 1.920 版本且无法立即升级，可执行以下临时缓解措施：编辑 /etc/webmin/miniserv.conf 文件，删除 passwd_mode= 配置行，保存后执行 /etc/webmin/restart 命令重启 Webmin 服务，以禁用过期密码修改功能阻断利用路径。此外，建议同时轮换所有系统管理员密码及 Webmin 访问密钥，并检查 /etc/webmin/miniserv.conf 中是否存在异常配置，确保 Webmin 管理界面仅通过 VPN 或 IP 访问控制列表进行访问限制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154141/Webmin-1.920-Remote-Command-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154141/Webmin-Remote-Comman-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154197/Webmin-1.920-password_change.cgi-Backdoor.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154485/Webmin-1.920-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://www.pentest.com.tr/exploits/DEFCON-Webmin-1920-Unauthenticated-Remote-Command-Execution.html","http://www.webmin.com/security.html","https://attackerkb.com/topics/hxx3zmiCkR/webmin-password-change-cgi-command-injection","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47230","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-15107","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47293","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15107.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-15107.md","https://github.com/Mr-xn/Penetration_Testing_POC/blob/6602db50598d0ed3bff77588ae1140dbe71a025c/web/CVE-2019-15107 Webmin 1.920 远程命令执行漏洞.md","https://github.com/Mr-xn/Penetration_Testing_POC/blob/6602db50598d0ed3bff77588ae1140dbe71a025c/vuln_pocs/cve/CVE-2019-15107/README.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/aaba13955b6f4608c4d9d9901b41c86a0a514345/2019/CVE-2019-15107.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/Web应用漏洞/Webmin 远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2019-15107.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/webmin/CVE-2019-15107.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/Web应用漏洞/Webmin password_change.cgi 远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2019-15107.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/webapp/Webmin-远程命令执行漏洞-CVE-2019-15107.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-15107/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2019-15107.py","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/Webmin_远程命令执行（CVE-2019-15107）漏洞利用.md","https://github.com/jas502n/CVE-2019-15107","https://github.com/MuirlandOracle/CVE-2019-15107","https://github.com/K3ysTr0K3R/CVE-2019-15107-EXPLOIT","https://github.com/hannob/webminex","https://github.com/kh4sh3i/Webmin-CVE"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0609.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0609.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0609.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0082","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0082.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-14789","title":"WordPress Custom 404 Pro 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"用于 WordPress 的 Custom 404 Pro 插件 3.2.8 及更早版本存在基于 DOM 的反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该插件在 WordPress 后台管理页面 wp-admin/admin.php?page=c4p-main 的搜索参数中未对用户输入进行充分的过滤和转义，攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 URL（如注入 svg onload 事件载荷）诱使具有插件访问权限的认证用户点击，从而在受害者浏览器上下文中执行任意脚本。该漏洞影响 Custom 404 Pro 插件低于 3.2.9 的所有版本，攻击者可借此窃取基于 Cookie 的身份验证凭据、劫持管理员会话，或在站点上下文中发起进一步攻击。官方已在 3.2.9 版本中通过补充输入过滤和输出转义修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-14789"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-15T16:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:19:01Z","remediation":"将 Custom 404 Pro 插件升级到 3.2.9 或更高版本。登录 WordPress 后台，进入插件管理页面，点击 Custom 404 Pro 的\"更新\"按钮完成升级；若自动更新失败，可手动下载最新版本覆盖安装。升级后确保 wp-admin/admin.php?page=c4p-main 页面的 page 参数已正确过滤，不再反射用户输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/custom-404-pro/#developers","https://www.pluginvulnerabilities.com/2019/06/25/other-vulnerability-data-sources-miss-that-a-reflected-xss-vulnerability-in-custom-404-pro-hasnt-been-fixed/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14789.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-14789.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14789.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-14789.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bfe508b10fd666e08d016fd72fb8c9e7ad67f3a1/cves/2019/14xxx/CVE-2019-14789.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-15838.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/CVE-2019-14789.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-14789.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/d89a4438a6b6037fedd5df1c832dbac48d3b31b3/nuclei-templates/2019/CVE-2019-14789-custom_404_pro-c4aceec4-4832-4d83-98b3-f705c391b0c9.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-14789.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-14789.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0082.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0084","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0084.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-14974","title":"SugarCRM Enterprise 9.0.0 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"tags.<value>SugarCRM Enterprise 9.0.0 的移动端错误页面 `mobile/error-not-supported-platform.html` 未对 `desktop_url` 参数进行充分过滤，导致存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的特制 URL 并诱骗用户点击，在受害者浏览器中执行任意脚本，从而窃取会话 Cookie、重定向用户至恶意站点或进行其他恶意操作。该漏洞影响 SugarCRM Enterprise 9.0.0 版本，攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，需要用户交互触发才能利用。CVSS v3 评分为 6.1，危害等级为中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-14974"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-14T16:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:19:25Z","remediation":"建议将 SugarCRM Enterprise 升级至 9.0.1 或更高版本。对于无法立即升级的系统，可通过修改 `mobile/error-not-supported-platform.html` 文件，对 `desktop_url` 参数实施严格的 URL 编码处理或白名单过滤，防止恶意脚本注入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47247","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14974.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-14974.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/9f2a6e9f8ef80998f730c790dd18087952b57414/2019/CVE-2019-14974.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14974.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-14974.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/low/cve-2019-14974-3862.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/low/cve-2019-14974-3866.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-14974-3865.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-14974-3867.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2019-14974.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/low/CVE-2019-14974.yaml","https://github.com/conan-sudo/CVE-2019-14974-bypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0084.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0004","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0344","title":"SAP Commerce Cloud virtualjdbc 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"SAP Commerce Cloud（原 Hybris）的 virtualjdbc 扩展组件存在不安全的反序列化漏洞（CWE-502）。远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过发送特制的序列化数据触发该漏洞，从而在目标机器上以 Hybris 用户权限执行任意代码，导致远程代码执行（RCE）。该漏洞影响版本包括 6.4, 6.5, 6.6, 6.7 以及 1808, 1811, 1905 等，CVSS 评分高达 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0344"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-08-14T14:15:16Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:08:12Z","remediation":"建议立即将 SAP Commerce Cloud 升级至官方发布的修复版本（如 1905 及以上版本），或安装对应的安全补丁以修复 virtualjdbc 扩展的反序列化漏洞。如无法立即升级，建议在防火墙或网络层限制对 virtualjdbc 相关接口的外部访问，以降低被远程攻击的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/2786035","https://wiki.scn.sap.com/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=523998017","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-0344","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0344.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b55a0e6faed5f81ed4c75a7b8a6ed2ea8e5965a3/cves/2019/0xxx/CVE-2019-0344.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6e7571de2d083c2588093ee3ef73d1501282312b/2019/0xxx/CVE-2019-0344.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-0344.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-0344.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/041916a4bbe5f9cbf864643dca3b8c710245f3cd/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-0344.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/041916a4bbe5f9cbf864643dca3b8c710245f3cd/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-0344.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/7bcae4092a8db60e560ad4ab3889774b6bdc0875/CVEs/2019/CVE-2019-0344.md","https://github.com/nailara-technologies/protocol-7/blob/c841f949062956a82819bbe73172a8454c8e66da/data/protocols/cisa/CVE-2019-0344","https://github.com/GrrrDog/Java-Deserialization-Cheat-Sheet/blob/a9d35815adcc5053862397362675ac105d1b976b/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0079","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0079.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-14530","title":"OpenEMR 路径遍历漏洞","description":"OpenEMR 是一款广泛使用的开源电子病历管理系统。该漏洞存在于 custom/ajax_download.php 文件中，攻击者通过 fileName 参数构造路径遍历请求，可下载服务器上 www-data 用户可读的任意文件。此外，若目标文件对 www-data 用户可写且 /var/www/openemr/sites/default/documents/cqm_qrda/ 目录存在，该文件将被删除。此漏洞影响 5.0.2 之前的所有 OpenEMR 版本，攻击者需要具备有效的系统账户凭据才能利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-14530"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-13T14:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:18:35Z","remediation":"升级 OpenEMR 至 5.0.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 custom/ajax_download.php 中 fileName 参数路径遍历漏洞（补丁见 https://github.com/openemr/openemr/pull/2592）。若暂时无法升级，可通过 Web 服务器配置限制对 custom/ajax_download.php 的访问权限，仅允许可信 IP 访问该文件，或暂时禁用该文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/163215/OpenEMR-5.0.1.7-Path-Traversal.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/163375/OpenEMR-5.0.1.7-Path-Traversal.html","https://github.com/Hacker5preme/Exploits/tree/main/CVE-2019-14530-Exploit","https://github.com/Wezery/CVE-2019-14530","https://github.com/openemr/openemr/pull/2592","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/50037","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14530.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-14530.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/9f2a6e9f8ef80998f730c790dd18087952b57414/2019/CVE-2019-14530.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14530.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-14530.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d8e64276ccc0390c8b8282c06f13ee665a5b9592/cves/2019/14xxx/CVE-2019-14530.json","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2019-14530.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/open-emr/openemr/CVE-2019-14530.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-14530.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-14530/poc/nuclei/CVE-2019-14530.yaml","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-14530.md","https://github.com/sec-it/exploit-CVE-2019-14530"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0079.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0068","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0068.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-13462","title":"Lansweeper 未授权SQL注入漏洞","description":"Lansweeper IT资产管理软件在7.1.117.4版本之前存在未授权SQL注入漏洞（CWE-89）。攻击者可通过向`/WidgetHandler.ashx?MethodName=Sort&ID=1`端点发送包含恶意SQL语句的特制HTTP GET请求，利用`row`和`column`参数在无需身份认证的情况下直接向后台数据库注入任意SQL查询，导致攻击者能够窃取敏感数据、获取数据库信息甚至完全控制整个Lansweeper系统。该漏洞影响所有部署了受影响版本Lansweeper的服务器，CVSS评分为9.1，危害等级严重。厂商已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至7.1.117.4或更高版本以消除安全风险。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-13462"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-12T17:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:16:47Z","remediation":"立即升级 Lansweeper 至 7.1.117.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复未授权 SQL 注入漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 WAF 或反向代理层配置规则，拦截对 `/WidgetHandler.ashx` 路径中 `row` 和 `column` 参数包含 SQL 语句的请求，并限制对 Lansweeper Web 控制台的网络访问范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.lansweeper.com/forum/yaf_topics33_Announcements.aspx","https://www.nccgroup.trust/uk/our-research/technical-advisory-unauthenticated-sql-injection-in-lansweeper/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-13462.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-13462.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-13462.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-13462.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-13462-3816.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-13462-3818.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-13462-3821.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-13462-3820.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-13462-3819.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2019-13462.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Lansweeper/CVE-2019-13462.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0068.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0083","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0083.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-14950","title":"WordPress wp-live-chat-support插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress wp-live-chat-support插件8.0.27版本之前存在跨站脚本漏洞。该漏洞源于GDPR页面对用户输入内容缺乏充分的过滤与转义，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意JavaScript代码的请求诱骗管理员或高权限用户访问该页面，从而在用户浏览器端执行任意脚本代码。由于攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低且无需任何权限，但需要用户点击触发，成功利用后可导致会话劫持、敏感信息窃取或后台管理员权限被接管，对使用该插件的WordPress站点安全构成威胁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-14950"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-12T15:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:19:23Z","remediation":"立即升级 WordPress wp-live-chat-support 插件至 8.0.27 或更高版本。进入 WordPress 管理后台，点击「插件」→「已安装插件」，找到 wp-live-chat-support 并执行更新。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用该插件或删除插件目录下的 GDPR 相关页面文件以阻断攻击面。更新完成后建议清除浏览器缓存及 CDN 缓存，确保新版本代码正常生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-live-chat-support/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14950.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-14950.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14950.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/52138c35bcb0784b4efb0e41fb1e599736d809a9/cves/2019/14xxx/CVE-2019-14950.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-14950.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/CVE-2019-14950.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-14950.rules","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/d89a4438a6b6037fedd5df1c832dbac48d3b31b3/nuclei-templates/2019/CVE-2019-14950-wp_live_chat_support-35b5a6ab-8909-49aa-8427-19355e6a7303.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-14950_2.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-14950_1.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2019-14950.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0083.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0083.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0083.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0300","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-11581","title":"Atlassian Jira Server and Data Center 服务器端模板注入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Atlassian Jira Server 与 Data Center 的 ContactAdministrators 和 SendBulkMail 功能中存在服务端模板注入漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响版本的 Jira 发送特制的邮件模板请求，利用 Velocity 模板引擎解析用户输入，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Jira Server 和 Data Center 从 4.4.0 到 7.6.14、7.7.0 到 7.13.5、8.0.0 到 8.0.3、8.1.0 到 8.1.2 以及 8.2.0 到 8.2.3 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。Atlassian 已在 2019 年 8 月的安全公告中发布修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-11581"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-09T20:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:13:12Z","remediation":"立即升级 Jira Server/Data Center 至以下安全版本：7.6.14+、7.13.5+、8.0.3+、8.1.2+ 或 8.2.3+。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层限制对 `/secure/ContactAdministrators!default.jspa` 和 `/secure/admin/SendBulkMail!default.jspa` 路径的外部访问，或禁用 SMTP 邮件模板自定义功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRASERVER-69532","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-11581","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-11581.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-11581.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-11581.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-11581-3757.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/Web应用漏洞/Atlassian Jira 模板注入漏洞 CVE-2019-11581.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/jira/CVE-2019-11581.md","https://github.com/r1cksec/cheatsheets/blob/c4f3f62fd2230bb894ed095a6e7da8142678ff2d/exploit/CVE-2019-11581.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/webapp/Atlassian-Jira-模板注入漏洞-CVE-2019-11581.md","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/xrayFiles/jira-cve-2019-11581.yml","https://github.com/amcai/myscan/blob/c0ed549669ec76cc9fea660554943244cbdd703b/myscan/pocs/perfolder/jira/poc_jira-cve-2019-11581_2019.py","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-11581/poc/xray/CVE-2019-11581.yml","https://github.com/jas502n/CVE-2019-11581","https://github.com/kobs0N/CVE-2019-11581","https://github.com/r0hack/RCE-in-Jira","https://github.com/PetrusViet/CVE-2019-11581"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0300.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0300.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0075","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0075.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-14312","title":"Aptana Jaxer 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"Aptana Jaxer 1.0.3.4547 版本的 wikilite 源码查看器存在路径遍历漏洞。低权限远程攻击者可通过构造包含目录遍历序列的请求，向 `tools/sourceViewer/index.html?filename=../` 发送特制 URI，从而读取服务器上的任意内部文件，造成敏感信息泄露。该漏洞利用无需用户交互，攻击者只需能够网络访问目标服务器的 Jaxer 服务即可触发，成功利用后可获取配置文件、源代码等敏感数据。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-14312"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-09T13:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:18:11Z","remediation":"Aptana Jaxer 项目已停止维护且未发布官方补丁，建议立即删除或禁用 aptana/tools/sourceViewer/ 目录以阻断 wikilite 源码查看器的路径遍历攻击面；如业务依赖 Samples 和 Tools 演示功能，应在 Apache/Nginx 等前端代理中配置访问控制规则，禁止外部访问 /aptana/tools/sourceViewer/index.html 路径并对 filename 参数进行严格过滤；长期方案建议迁移至其他持续维护的 Web 服务器产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153985/Aptana-Jaxer-1.0.3.4547-Local-File-Inclusion.html","https://github.com/aptana/Jaxer/commits/master","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47214","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14312.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-14312.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14312.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-14312.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-14312-3839.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-14312-3841.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-14312-3844.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-14312-3842.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-14312-3843.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2019-14312.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Aptana Jaxer/CVE-2019-14312.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0075.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0063","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0063.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-13101","title":"D-Link DIR-600M 认证绕过漏洞","description":"D-Link DIR-600M 无线路由器存在认证绕过漏洞（CWE-306），其 wan.htm 页面未实施任何身份验证机制，远程攻击者无需任何凭证即可直接访问该页面，导致 WAN 口配置信息（如 IP 地址、DNS、MAC 地址等）泄露，并可进一步修改页面中的数据字段，实现对路由器 WAN 设置的未授权篡改。该漏洞影响固件版本 3.02、3.03、3.04 及 3.06，攻击者只需知道目标路由器的 IP 地址即可通过浏览器直接访问 wan.htm 触发，无需用户交互，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-13101"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-08T13:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:16:03Z","remediation":"建议立即将 D-Link DIR-600M 固件升级至厂商提供的最新安全版本（如已停止支持则升级至 3.07 及以上版本）。如无法升级，可在路由器管理界面中设置仅允许内网特定 IP 访问管理页面，并在网络边界防火墙中阻断对路由器 80/8080 端口的外部访问，同时禁用 WAN 侧远程管理功能以降低暴露面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153994/D-Link-DIR-600M-Wireless-N-150-Home-Router-Access-Bypass.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/Aug/5","https://github.com/d0x0/D-Link-DIR-600M/blob/master/CVE-2019-13101","https://seclists.org/bugtraq/2019/Aug/17","https://us.dlink.com/en/security-advisory","https://www.ftc.gov/system/files/documents/cases/dlink_proposed_order_and_judgment_7-2-19.pdf","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47250","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-13101.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-13101.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/15bf95c7b4616c8551a2bd666d40a8a1a07282d6/2019/CVE-2019-13101.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-13101.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-13101.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-13101-3804.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-13101-3805.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-13101-3806.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-13101-3802.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/D-Link/CVE-2019-13101.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-13101/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2019-13101.py","https://github.com/halencarjunior/dlkploit600"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0063.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0063.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0063.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0081","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0081.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-14750","title":"Enhancesoft osTicket 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"osTicket 是一款开源技术支持工单系统。在 1.10.7 之前版本及 1.12.x 1.12.1 之前版本中，setup/install.php 存在存储型跨站脚本漏洞。由于应用程序的 firstname 和 lastname 字段未对用户输入进行任何过滤和转义，攻击者可在这些字段中插入恶意脚本代码并提交保存，当其他管理员或用户访问包含恶意数据的页面时，脚本将在受害者浏览器中执行，进而导致会话 Cookie 被盗取或其他恶意操作。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-14750"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-07T17:15:12Z","updated":"2026-07-10T18:20:35Z","remediation":"tags.<value>升级 osTicket 至 1.10.7 或 1.12.1 及以上版本，以修复 setup/install.php 中对 firstname 和 lastname 字段输入过滤不足导致的存储型跨站脚本漏洞。若短期内无法完成版本升级，可在 Web 服务器层面对 setup/install.php 实施访问控制，仅允许可信 IP 访问安装页面，作为临时缓解措施降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154005/osTicket-1.12-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","https://github.com/osTicket/osTicket/commit/c3ba5b78261e07a883ad8fac28c214486c854e12","https://github.com/osTicket/osTicket/releases/tag/v1.10.7","https://github.com/osTicket/osTicket/releases/tag/v1.12.1","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47226","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14750.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-14750.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14750.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-14750.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/osticket/osticket/CVE-2019-14750.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bfe508b10fd666e08d016fd72fb8c9e7ad67f3a1/cves/2019/14xxx/CVE-2019-14750.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-14750.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-14750.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/CVE-2019-14750.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-14750.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-14750.yaml","https://github.com/0xn0ne/weblogicScanner"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0081.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0081.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0080","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0080.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-14696","title":"Open-School 学生监护人管理功能跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Open-School 3.0 及 Community Edition 2.3 存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，源于应用程序在 osv/index.php?r=students/guardians/create 页面的 id 参数处未对用户输入进行充分过滤与转义，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 URL 并诱导管理员或用户点击访问，从而在受害者的浏览器中执行任意脚本。该漏洞利用条件为网络可达（AV:N），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需身份验证（PR:N），但需要用户交互（UI:R），可对同域下的其他会话造成 Cookie 窃取、会话劫持及页面篡改等危害。影响版本为 Open-School 3.0 及 Community Edition 2.3，CVSS v3.0 评分为 6.1（MEDIUM），CWE 类型为 CWE-79（跨站脚本）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-14696"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-06T16:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:18:50Z","remediation":"Open-School 官方未发布针对此漏洞的修复版本。建议在 osv/index.php?r=students/guardians/create 页面代码中对 id 参数增加输入验证，仅允许数字格式并通过 htmlspecialchars 过滤后输出；同时在 Web 服务器或 WAF 层面配置拦截包含 &lt;script&gt; 等 HTML 标签的请求，作为临时缓解措施可暂时禁用学生监护人创建功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153984/Open-School-3.0-Community-Edition-2.3-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","https://open-school.org","https://pastebin.com/AgxqdbAQ","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47212","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14696.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-14696.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14696.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-14696.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-14696-3861.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-14696-3860.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-14696-3856.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-14696-3859.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2019-14696.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14696.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Open-School/CVE-2019-14696.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0080.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0002","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0002.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0193","title":"Apache Solr DataImportHandler 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Apache Solr 的 DataImportHandler（DIH）模块存在远程命令执行漏洞。DIH 是 Solr 中用于从数据库等数据源导入数据的可选功能模块，其调试模式允许通过 HTTP 请求中的 `dataConfig` 参数直接传入完整的 DIH 配置。由于 DIH 配置支持嵌入脚本代码，攻击者可在未授权情况下向 Solr 服务端发送特制的 dataConfig 参数，触发任意命令执行，进而完全控制服务器。该漏洞影响 Apache Solr 8.2.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。官方已在 Solr 8.2.0 中通过引入 `enable.dih.dataConfigParam` 系统属性开关进行修复，默认关闭该危险参数。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0193"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-01T14:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:07:55Z","remediation":"升级至 Apache Solr 8.2.0 及以上版本，该版本默认禁用通过 dataConfig 参数注入脚本的功能。如无法升级，在启动参数中添加 `-Denable.dih.dataConfigParam=false` 或不在 solr.in.sh 中设置该参数为 true。同时建议在反向代理层限制 `/solr/*/dataimport*` 路径的访问权限，仅允许受信 IP 访问 Solr Admin 管理界面，并移除未使用的 DataImportHandler 插件配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/SOLR-13669","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/1addbb49a1fc0947fb32ca663d76d93cfaade35a4848a76d4b4ded9c%40%3Cissues.lucene.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/42cc4d334ba33905b872a0aa00d6a481391951c8b1450f01b077ce74%40%3Cissues.lucene.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/55880d48e38ba9e8c41a3b9e41051dbfdef63b86b0cfeb32967edf03%40%3Cissues.lucene.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/6f2d61bd8732224c5fd3bdd84798f8e01e4542d3ee2f527a52a81b83%40%3Cissues.lucene.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/7143983363f0ba463475be4a8b775077070a08dbf075449b7beb51ee%40%3Cissues.lucene.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/9b0e7a7e3e18d0724f511403b364fc082ff56e3134d84cfece1c82fc%40%3Cissues.lucene.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/a6e3c09dba52b86d3a1